{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Bhadrā","html":"<article id='thig1.9'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.9 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.9 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Bhadrātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Bhadrā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhadrā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Saddhāya pabbajitvāna, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Having gone forth in faith, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“Now that you have gone forth out of faith, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>bhadre bhadraratā bhava; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>appreciate your blessings, Bhadrā. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Bhadrā, be devoted to goodness. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Bhāvehi kusale dhamme, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Develop skillful qualities </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Cultivate wholesome qualities, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>yogakkhemamanuttaran”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>for the sake of the supreme sanctuary from the yoke. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>the utmost safety from bondage.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Bhadrā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Bhadrā </span></p></article>"}
